  "notes": [
    "User requested production/politics cleanup on 2026-10-30. Explicit layout changes are recorded separately; existing required widget paths and callbacks remain.",
    "Production summary contains six baked military/naval factory glyphs. Keep those exact 20x22 patches, move 8px left, and reserve a separate 24px count field for up to three digits.",
    "Naval background frames encode 5/10/15 factory slots. Rebuild the same 5-column 1/2/3-row grids and retain original alpha and frame count. Outdated/progress/equipment/resource/category sprites remain native; selection overlays are restyled separately.",
    "MIO decorative strip becomes silver with a gold edge distinct from the white unassigned row. Its alpha and the MIO attachment icon remain.",
    "Retained green speed bars are drawn over a new fixed navy field, with white 16px speed text. Body labels and empty-slot faces are black/white.",
    "Only the Economic Alliance entry button bypasses the whole-file font preservation rule through an explicit override; all existing EA theme fonts remain unchanged.",
    "Native selected-row images are opaque dark backgrounds. Replace them with a pale-blue name band, navy outline and transparent body so black names stay readable and the underlying 5/10/15 factory slot count remains visible. This deliberately reduces body alpha; outside-source opacity is never introduced."
  ]
}
